      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了秋天的大舞台“天皇赏（秋）”，\n充满热血的“夏季集训”即将展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01765ea4c948c677c5b622f9e80e99101bc0e2e8d8782ed51b2a6748ce8ab0ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
