    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d37d524b269eacb425010f2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“春季S”当天。\n原本应该是气氛非常热烈的比赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5809061a9ae07bde3c7a3b61896c6879232befed411a0e7e2b9a247ee0a3fbf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3929addee370c2d1bf8245",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但因为许多赛马娘逃避与丸善斯基对决，\n结果只剩下勉强能举行比赛的人数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb77ac1586b945f194219849298ec4bed892ea7be7310b9bdf39b4c8e3e26261",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46dc05eb4ce6bd0d19dadcf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，丸善斯基仍说要享受比赛，\n走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9527a77430069fc767a783e615f1e2adffac274afbb08340ef8f5c24c3daa83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8cbf5fe6f84ae28bc2646d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向春季S",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54a359acf1521645234de441475be13653284af09ff1da85c412c8a8373ccc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004410.json",
