      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对这欢声雷动的大舞台，\n就算是丸善斯基也难掩紧张的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c17221cbe2994b62531ee4cfed49307fce9ac3570d68aa689f4e76412af95776",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9885c9bb2aa37820c5fbec99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，\n为了尽情享受这场日本第一的竞赛……\n她仍激励自己，朝会场前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7968666ed7b05c729968c7a785e400a11fced80b1c9795961c03f095473810a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
