      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基心想终于能够与她一决胜负，\n这肯定会是一场开心的比赛……\n接着前往参加对决了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6ef985c869e95385caaa06ae200fe4a473786b114744e9e5839fe39cae690a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
