      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有在竞赛上才能体会的感觉使她情绪高昂，\n为了踏上决定新马级王者的最棒舞台──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead9801a921e1e88c57a85fbf254e67edc17cc72e4026505a6d5e4c0fa59f922",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
