      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……当她前往接受记者采访时，\n背影似乎带着一丝忧郁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22f42abc92cebb042cd988ef84ac42b4416a9968ae70eb695fe9846e5c8b3dc",
