      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当天夜晚，训练员碰巧遇到了\n看完丸善斯基的比赛后，\n内心雀跃不已的特别周。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848eb36c9506b9177de5a637480decf8908ec7704ec515071ca8067e410b4a83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
