      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了回应她们的期待，丸善斯基微笑着说\n会在“日本德比”跑出最棒的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f7d18bff144b56d52b2790bf595544a0c6b47206fe8ae398f3e6852f8da93db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
