    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee07224bca09409b705bd6dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员对回来的丸善斯基\n提议挑战“有马纪念”……\n这是向世人展现跑步实力的最佳舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6d49dc1f2c79d07633bd0bc7bba22e4e0d6794789d098f3ab7e9d27d879f0ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9bbf818dea1630c3132556",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她虽然惊讶，但也接受了提议，\n决定下一个目标是“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d2bfc4cdcc8d2266bcccea91445fd9932e14335cc9b9be13084f28332b960b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004421.json",
