    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9ff97fe34cf5375c0d74fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基展现出连鲁道夫象征\n都深受吸引的跑法，赢得了胜利。\n她决定下一个目标是“安田纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a4d30304462f26df0fe8c41163fc90bf6adf9ae45232f030b7b50711bb1306",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004423.json",
