    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86ec92c7e418bca188e9d867",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征发誓将与丸善斯基再战，\n并且宣布一定会追上其背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e585b9aa17d5080239d06457f78a5e5b6bbb7dedb7aa3c03e33f70b46d86909a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9e6ad6055352a6e1d89e62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，\n丸善斯基那吸引了许多人的奔跑模样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb23ce4a9d435b45fc5f136e6cda1e96d11d408c7b8cb2ce43bbc9db98971dc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f244897f1af81f3d3b4d2cdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "却在特别周和草上飞心中留下了\n另一番深刻的印象。\n那就是，压迫感十足的高墙这个巨大形象……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e575aa138364105f96c543d4bd9c1c94b28a8b38fb257da1305218b5d7ebc568",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
