      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与后辈开心比完赛后，她顺势\n决定下一场比赛将是“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4b00ca8d1e5c11865aa9571d75633e16af34e866657bb9978ae2654f42ad7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
