      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "亲眼观赏了两人比赛的特别周，\n不再像以前那样焦虑，而是涌现了一股热情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8df7530ac003e781c8ca5e6f8eae5c56784ad851cfb840c134a8bdfd9f68b55",
